 "remarks": "Why rent when you can own this great opportunity in the heart of SONO! This Ben Franklin one bedroom condominium has the original owner since 1990! Offering 615 square feet on the second floor front corner unit provides a tree lined Summer privacy. Newly installed city sidewalks makes for easy pedestrian access to Sono train station and all downtown shops, restaurants, and eateries! Also just a few blocks from the Sono Collection shopping mall and I-95 as well as the Maritime Aquarium and Norwalk Harbor water views at Oyster park, Mathews mansion and Veterans park! A wonderful opportunity for affordable living in the city of Norwalk!",
